# Nucleus — AI System Patterns

## Model Rules (Locked)
```
claude-haiku-4-5-20251001  → all default chat, chart generation, diagram generation
claude-sonnet-4-6          → autonomous mode ONLY
```
Never use any other model. Never swap these without explicit instruction.

## Every AI Route Must Start With This
```ts
export async function POST(req: Request) {
  const supabase = await createClient()
  const { data: { user }, error: authError } = await supabase.auth.getUser()
  if (authError || !user) return new Response('Unauthorized', { status: 401 })

  const proError = await requirePro(supabase)
  if (proError) return proError
  
  // rest of route...
}
```

## Prompt Caching (Required on All Anthropic Calls)
```ts
// Always include these headers
const response = await anthropic.messages.create({
  model: 'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001',
  max_tokens: 8096,
  system: [{ 
    type: 'text', 
    text: systemPrompt,
    cache_control: { type: 'ephemeral' }  // ← always include
  }],
  messages,
}, {
  headers: { 'anthropic-beta': 'prompt-caching-2024-07-31' }  // ← always include
})
```

## SSE Streaming Pattern
```ts
const stream = new TransformStream()
const writer = stream.writable.getWriter()
const encoder = new TextEncoder()

const send = (data: object) => {
  writer.write(encoder.encode(`data: ${JSON.stringify(data)}\n\n`))
}

// Emit text chunks
send({ type: 'text', content: chunk })

// Emit tool results
send({ type: 'tool_result', toolName, result })

// Always close
send({ type: 'done' })
writer.close()

return new Response(stream.readable, {
  headers: {
    'Content-Type': 'text/event-stream',
    'Cache-Control': 'no-cache',
    'Connection': 'keep-alive',
  }
})
```

## Tool Registration (lib/ai/execute-tool.ts)
- All tool execution goes through `executeToolCall()` in `lib/ai/execute-tool.ts`
- Never write tool execution logic inside an API route directly
- To add a new tool: add definition to `features/ai/tools/index.ts`, add handler to `lib/ai/execute-tool.ts`

## Current Tools (11 — Don't Duplicate)
```
get_clusters, get_notes, get_tasks, get_flashcards,
create_cluster, create_note, create_task, create_flashcard,
create_flashcard_set, create_chart_note, create_diagram_note
```

## Agent Loop Rules
- Manual mode: Haiku, streaming text only, no tools
- Assisted mode: Haiku, max 5 iterations, max 1 write operation
- Autonomous mode: Sonnet, max 15 iterations
- Loop lives in `lib/ai/run-agent-loop.ts` — never reimplement this inline

## requirePro Location
```ts
import { requirePro } from '@/lib/ai/require-pro'
```
Returns a Response object if the user is not Pro, null if they are. Always check for null before continuing.

## Conversation Persistence Rules
- Client creates conversation in `ai_conversations` before first message
- Messages saved to `ai_messages` after stream completes — not during
- `attachments` column in ai_messages is jsonb — store as array of {url, type} objects
- `tool_results` column in ai_messages is jsonb — store raw tool output
